    "detailed_description": "<strong>Test your logic and unveil the hidden images in this pixel art puzzle game!</strong><br><br>Each level presents a blank canvas surrounded by mysterious numbers. These hold the key to a pixel art image waiting to be discovered. Use your logic and deduction skills to strategically paint the grid, one pixel at a time. Each color choice reveals a piece of the puzzle, bringing the hidden image to life.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754240/extras/7912483f7ffb8f96765709597ce6f9ec.poster.avif?t=1713319964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754240/extras/7912483f7ffb8f96765709597ce6f9ec.webm?t=1713319964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>200 Handcrafted Levels:</strong> Dive into a diverse range of puzzles, from beginner-friendly to mind-bending challenges.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlock the Secrets at Your Pace:</strong> Explore the hidden images at your own speed, with over 3 hours of content waiting to be discovered.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>8 Achievements Await:</strong> Strive for pixel perfection and unlock every achievement in the game.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Puzzle Generator:</strong> Experience an infinite puzzle with a random generator creating unique patterns of scattered pixels every time you play.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Are you ready to take on the pixel puzzle challenge?</strong>",
